<Base title="Sponsors" description="Featured Tomes: sponsor a book in Tomebound Tactics. Flat per-epoch pricing, no pay-to-win, ever.">
  <span class="badge">In development</span>
  <h1>Featured Tomes</h1>
  <p class="lede">A Featured Tome is a book a publisher sponsors into the game's study flow for one epoch. Players who study it get a featured study — faster, more certain — but never stronger. Sponsors buy efficiency and certainty, never extra power.</p>

  <img class="hero-img" src="/sponsors.webp" alt="An open antique book glowing with golden light on a desk, with a quill and gold coins beside it" />

  <h2>What a sponsor gets</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ul>
      <li>A featured slot in the study flow for one eight-week epoch.</li>
      <li>The book's study grants its page skill like any other book — the feature is about being found, not about being stronger.</li>
      <li>Placement in the epoch canon, which doubles as the game's reading list for the epoch.</li>
      <li>Co-marketing through the game's channels and the library pilot, where the pilot libraries display the canon.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Pricing card</h2>
  <p>Flat pricing per epoch. No cost-per-click, no cost-per-install — a slot is a slot.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Stage</th><th>Per epoch, per slot</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Founding rate (first epoch)</td><td>$200 – $300</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Soft launch (about 1,000 daily players)</td><td>$400 – $750</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Growth (about 10,000 daily players)</td><td>$2,500 – $6,000</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <ul>
    <li>Multi-epoch bookings: 10–25% discount.</li>
    <li>Exclusivity within a category: 20–50% premium.</li>
    <li>Rates reviewed every six months, adjusted 10–20%.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The rule that protects the game</h2>
  <p>A featured study still consumes the wizard's one study for the day. Featured Tomes never grant an extra study, never grant extra power, and never appear in ranked play as an advantage. That rule is the reason players will trust the feature — and the reason it is worth sponsoring.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0">Talk to us</h3>
    <p>To sponsor a title in the launch epoch, Alchemist Reign, write to <strong><a href="mailto:castspells@tomeboundtactics.com">castspells@tomeboundtactics.com</a></strong>. Include the title, its publication date, and the epoch you have in mind.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
